#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:1
msgid "Nexus 文档页面模板"
msgstr "Nexus documentation page templates"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:3
msgid ""
"模板是必须回答的问题清单。标题可以按任务调整；已有规范通过包含或链接复用。 新增/修改正文遵守 [内容与图示标准](documentation-"
"standards.md)，不得仅有页面 元数据就记录内容合格。实际教程代码来自已验证fixture或固定版本外部示例。"
msgstr ""
"Templates list questions every page must answer. Adapt headings to tasks and"
" reuse standards by inclusion/linking. New/changed prose follows "
"[content/diagram standards](documentation-standards.md); metadata alone does"
" not establish content quality. Tutorial code comes from verified fixtures "
"or pinned external examples."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:7
msgid "1. Tutorial"
msgstr "1. Tutorial"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:9
msgid "目标和预期完成结果。"
msgstr "Goal and expected completed outcome."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:10
msgid "适用代码/SDK版本、Board/OS/模式、工具、工作目录和设备前提。"
msgstr ""
"Applicable code/SDK version, Board/OS/mode, tools, working directory and "
"equipment prerequisites."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:11
msgid "输入、配置、所需资源；完整输入与片段分别标明。"
msgstr ""
"Inputs, configuration and resources; label complete inputs separately from "
"fragments."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:12
msgid "一条完整操作路径，每步给命令或API、预期结果和检查方法。"
msgstr ""
"One complete path with commands/APIs, expected results and checks for each "
"step."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:13
msgid "遇到常见拒绝/失败时如何定位和保持资源。"
msgstr "Diagnosing common rejection/failure while retaining resources."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:14
msgid "停机、排空、清理，以及结果/存储何时可以复用。"
msgstr "Shutdown, drain and cleanup; when results/storage may be reused."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:15
msgid "实际验证记录和下一步。"
msgstr "Actual validation records and next steps."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:17
msgid ""
"异步教程连接提交/取消/排空时序图；外部SDK教程连接消费流程图。没有设备时只 说明软件验证和HIL准备，不把未执行硬件步骤写成教程成功结果。"
msgstr ""
"Async tutorials link submission/cancellation/drain sequences; external-SDK "
"tutorials link consumer flows. Without equipment, describe software "
"validation/HIL preparation only rather than claiming hardware steps "
"succeeded."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:20
msgid "2. How-to"
msgstr "2. How-to"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:22
msgid "要完成的单一任务和适用范围。"
msgstr "One task and its applicable scope."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:23
msgid "合法Task/IRQ/权限上下文、输入和资源所有者。"
msgstr "Legal Task/IRQ/privilege context, inputs and resource owners."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:24
msgid "最短完整步骤；默认选择与例外明确。"
msgstr "Shortest complete steps with explicit defaults/exceptions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:25
msgid "正常结果、拒绝、超时/取消及失败恢复。"
msgstr "Normal results, rejection, timeout/cancel and failure recovery."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:26
msgid "结束后哪些资源已归还，哪些责任仍保留。"
msgstr "Resources returned and responsibilities still retained afterward."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:27
msgid "限制和对应权威合同。"
msgstr "Limitations and authoritative contracts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:29
msgid "可以省略基础原理并链接解释页，不能省略影响正确性的生命周期或并发条件。"
msgstr ""
"Link explanations instead of repeating fundamentals, but never omit "
"lifecycle/concurrency conditions affecting correctness."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:31
msgid "3. Reference"
msgstr "3. Reference"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "项目"
msgstr "Item"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "必需内容"
msgstr "Required content"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "字段/符号"
msgstr "Field/symbol"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "精确名称、类型和权威源"
msgstr "Exact name, type and authority."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "数值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "单位、范围、默认值及生效条件"
msgstr "Units, range, defaults and activation conditions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "组合"
msgstr "Combination"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "有效/无效模式、平台和ABI组合"
msgstr "Valid/invalid modes, platforms and ABIs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "调用"
msgstr "Call"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "上下文、deadline、输入/输出所有权"
msgstr "Context, deadlines and input/output ownership."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "失败"
msgstr "Failure"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "拒绝条件、状态变化、效果与后续责任"
msgstr ""
"Rejection conditions, state changes, effects and remaining responsibility."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "资格"
msgstr "Qualification"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:0
msgid "当前维护/软件/实板范围和证据入口"
msgstr "Maintained/software/physical scope and evidence entry."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:42
msgid ""
"API声明自动生成，手册不手抄第二份函数签名。引用完整配置或有原因的fragment。 "
"controller/endpoint、资源和内存布局复杂时连接结构图或精确参考配置图。"
msgstr ""
"Generate API declarations; manuals never hand-copy competing signatures. "
"Reference complete configurations or explain fragments. Complex "
"controller/endpoint, resource and memory relationships link "
"structural/exact-reference diagrams."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:45
msgid "4. Explanation"
msgstr "4. Explanation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:47
msgid "具体问题和约束。"
msgstr "Problem and constraints."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:48
msgid "当前或目标结构，图的身份与来源。"
msgstr "Current/target structure with diagram identity/sources."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:49
msgid "各层责任、状态和资源所有者。"
msgstr "Layer responsibilities, state and resource owners."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:50
msgid "构建阶段与运行阶段，以及依赖/调用/数据流的区别。"
msgstr ""
"Build/runtime stages and distinctions between dependencies, calls and data "
"flow."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:51
msgid "主要流程和失败责任；并发流程连接时序/状态图。"
msgstr ""
"Main flows/failure responsibilities; concurrent flows link sequences/state "
"diagrams."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:52
msgid "性能/空间成本、取舍和适用条件。"
msgstr "Performance/space costs, tradeoffs and conditions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:53
msgid "当前限制与实际验证范围。"
msgstr "Limitations and actual validation scope."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:54
msgid "关联合同、源码和操作指南。"
msgstr "Related contracts, source and how-to guides."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:56
msgid "架构解释必须有对应框图；单一简单事实可以引用已有图。无需重复画一张仅改变 颜色或名称的同义图。代码实现与目标提案不能在同一无标记图中合并。"
msgstr ""
"Architecture explanations must include corresponding diagrams; simple facts "
"may reference existing diagrams. Do not redraw equivalent diagrams only to "
"change colors/names. Never merge implementation and target proposals in one "
"unlabeled diagram."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:59
msgid "5. Status"
msgstr "5. Status"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:61
msgid "被描述代码、本文档和qualified source分别是什么。"
msgstr ""
"Separate identities of described code, documentation and qualified source."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:62
msgid "精确配置、scope、工具与实际执行结果。"
msgstr "Exact configuration/scope/tools and actual execution."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:63
msgid "可取得的证据、档案/member与校验方法。"
msgstr "Retrievable evidence, archives/members and verification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:64
msgid "已实现、已执行、未执行、失败或阻塞项。"
msgstr "Implemented, executed, unexecuted, failed or blocked items."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:65
msgid "支持和资格边界；下一退出条件。"
msgstr "Support/qualification boundaries and next exit conditions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:67
msgid ""
"表中的数字不能跨scope累加；implemented不替代软件/实板通过。资格流程图中 软件证据和HIL分别取得后汇合，不画成软件自动推进到物理通过。"
msgstr ""
"Never aggregate table numbers across scopes; implemented does not replace "
"software/physical passes. Evidence flows acquire software and HIL "
"independently before joining; software never automatically becomes physical "
"qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:70
msgid "6. 每页审查清单"
msgstr "6. Per-page review checklist"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:72
msgid "读者、目标、版本和适用范围明确。"
msgstr "Readers, goals, versions and scope are explicit."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:73
msgid "步骤或规则可执行/可判断，命令前提与预期结果齐全。"
msgstr ""
"Steps/rules are actionable/checkable with command prerequisites and expected"
" results."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:74
msgid "对象、单位、上下文、借用、失败和恢复明确。"
msgstr ""
"Objects, units, contexts, borrowing, failures and recovery are explicit."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:75
msgid "当前/目标/参考、实现/软件/HIL身份没有混淆。"
msgstr ""
"Current/target/reference and implementation/software/HIL identities stay "
"distinct."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:76
msgid "图中实体与每条边均可解释并与源码/合同一致。"
msgstr ""
"Every diagram entity/edge is explainable and matches source/contracts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:77
msgid "代码和配置例子有实际验证或明确片段原因。"
msgstr ""
"Code/configuration examples have actual validation or explicit fragment "
"rationale."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:78
msgid "正文、图和翻译没有复制出竞争规范。"
msgstr "Prose, diagrams and translations create no competing standards."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:79
msgid "引用、离线资源、alt/caption和旧URL处理正确。"
msgstr ""
"References, offline resources, alt/captions and legacy URLs are correct."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-templates.md:80
msgid "发现和修正记录绑定实际页面/图与来源。"
msgstr "Findings/fixes bind actual pages/diagrams and source identities."
